{"parse": {"title": "有琴歌-01", "pageid": 128592, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%91%9B%E5%A4%A9%C2%B7%E6%9C%89%E7%90%B4%E6%AD%8C\" title=\"葛天·有琴歌\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">有琴歌-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%89%E7%90%B4%E6%AD%8C-02\" title=\"有琴歌-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">有琴歌</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A7.89.E7.83.9B.E6.95.85.E4.BA.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"秉烛故事\">秉烛故事</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 秉烛故事</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Story Told by Candlelight</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">20:18　？？？ 雨</span></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_getian_icon_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory getian icon 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Rolestory_getian_icon_1.png/110px-Rolestory_getian_icon_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"116\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Rolestory_getian_icon_1.png/165px-Rolestory_getian_icon_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Rolestory_getian_icon_1.png/220px-Rolestory_getian_icon_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"540\" data-file-height=\"568\" /></a></div>\n<p>对于那些精通音律者，人类有各式各样的赞美之词。\n其中，格外夸张的一条是：当最为高妙的乐师演奏时，连凤鸟都会翩然落在他的肩上。<br />\n……<br />\n细碎的交谈声淹没在黑暗中。<br />\n好在，尚有一盏灯烛。<br />\n<small style=\"color: #999;\">点击电亮烛火</small><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_getian_interact_2_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory getian interact 2 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Rolestory_getian_interact_2_1.png/110px-Rolestory_getian_interact_2_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"91\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Rolestory_getian_interact_2_1.png/165px-Rolestory_getian_interact_2_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Rolestory_getian_interact_2_1.png/220px-Rolestory_getian_interact_2_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"304\" data-file-height=\"252\" /></a></div><div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory getian interact 2 2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png/110px-Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"107\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png/165px-Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png/220px-Rolestory_getian_interact_2_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"469\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">？？？</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>昏暗的灯光下，故事讲述者的面容终于隐隐浮现。<br />\n那是一位平平无奇的青年，眼中闪烁着飘忽不定的火焰。<br />\n世上太多这样的人类。<br />\n他们有的习惯了谎言，有的以忠诚为准则；有时把性命看得高于一切，下一个瞬间又会为旁人无法理解的东西葬送己身。<br />\n真是难以捉摸。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“从前，有一位天资卓绝的琴师。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“某年春天，他独自坐在梧桐树下，弹起一首新谱的乐曲。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“那是他生平得意之作，只是欠缺了收梢。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>听者似乎兴趣缺缺。乐师注意到这一点，清了清嗓子，一只手不由自主地在身侧摸索。<br />\n片刻后，似乎触碰到某种令人安心的东西，他再次开口。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“一曲终了，琴师抬起头，看见人首鸟身的仙人站在他的面前。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“他询问：为何不演奏下去？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“琴师回答：姑且写到这里，不知该如何继续。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“仙人便说：如此，我愿将它补完，成就一卷世间从未有过的绝妙乐谱。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>烛光太黯淡，听者的面孔仍然隐没于黑暗。乐师看到他用手指不耐烦地轻轻在桌面划圈。<br />\n——意料之中。这故事太俗套：不得意的人类总是对无法企及的世界怀揣诸多向往，期待着无寒无暑的仙人终有一天为自己垂下目光。<br />\n多么可笑，多么无聊。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“我可以向您证明此事。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>……或许，这次会有所不同。<br />\n一阵窸窣声。<br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_getian_icon_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory getian icon 2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Rolestory_getian_icon_2.png/110px-Rolestory_getian_icon_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"117\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Rolestory_getian_icon_2.png/165px-Rolestory_getian_icon_2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Rolestory_getian_icon_2.png/220px-Rolestory_getian_icon_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"534\" data-file-height=\"568\" /></a></div>\n<p>他把手边的物什放到桌面上，往烛火照亮的地方慢慢推去——那是<span class=\"tooltips\" style=\"cursor: help; color: #ff7a06;\">一张琴<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left; translate: 0px;\">一张有年头的琴。琴身已经生出断纹，漆胎也旧了，在灯下透出唯有长年被珍重地摩挲才会形成的光泽。<br />七根看不出材质的丝弦微微颤动，仿佛仍有一段未完的琴曲停留其上。</span></span>。<br />\n乐师又推去一把小刀。<br />\n听者漫不经心地接过，随手把玩：一把相当不错的斫琴刀，有着素色的锋利刚刃。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“请您试着割断琴弦。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>他用刀柄敲敲桌面作为回应。<br />\n他伸出手去。<br />\n……<br />\n刀尖在弦上一顿。<br />\n一挑。<br />\n然后划开。<br />\n<small style=\"color: #999;\">点击割断琴弦</small><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_getian_interact_1_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory getian interact 1 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Rolestory_getian_interact_1_1.png/110px-Rolestory_getian_interact_1_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"67\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Rolestory_getian_interact_1_1.png/165px-Rolestory_getian_interact_1_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Rolestory_getian_interact_1_1.png/220px-Rolestory_getian_interact_1_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"481\" data-file-height=\"293\" /></a></div><div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_getian_interact_1_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory getian interact 1 2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/Rolestory_getian_interact_1_2.png/110px-Rolestory_getian_interact_1_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/Rolestory_getian_interact_1_2.png/165px-Rolestory_getian_interact_1_2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/Rolestory_getian_interact_1_2.png/220px-Rolestory_getian_interact_1_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></div>\n<p>……<br />\n真是出乎意料。<br />\n他忍不住轻呼一声，凑近细看。<br />\n原来那不是普通的黑色丝弦，琴弦呈极淡的青灰，纹路近乎某种鸟羽，在跳动的烛光下泛出一线细细的银光。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“仙人与琴师一见如故，欣赏他的才华，就此留在人间；又用神秘术为他改换命格与骨相，令他事事顺遂，最终名扬天下。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>——改换命格与骨相。他略微坐直了些。<br />\n他听过这样荒诞不经的传闻。看来空穴来风，未必无因。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“我向您展示的，便是仙人羽毛制成的琴弦。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>听者于是挥手，示意他继续：下山的神鸟、天资出众的人类，改换命格的神秘术……是个好故事。<br />\n面前的乐师，或许也是合适的人……他会是个好乐师吗？好到足够吸引神鸟的目光？<br />\n饶有兴致的审视目光中，乐师深吸一口气。这并非他第一次与别人分享灭蒙鸟的传说，或许也不会是最后一次。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>乐师：</b></span>“故事里的琴师，正是我的先祖。”</div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "有琴歌-01"}}